{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1788328064560207001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"cloned-amoebalike-zebra","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"71048ebc3f715b52613d8859c10e4c46846787acc4cc5045b8ef0fb194235184","event_uuid":"4adf60e4-cbaa-4213-b9ca-bce1dfccec3a","position":{"commit_sha":"bcc0dae092807795f09237ad65b3ff16935a23b8","position":"1788313665159105001-4adf60e4-cbaa-4213-b9ca-bce1dfccec3a"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"75f1dcf8b0d95587c18111dbdf43fa38895a88f37a21633f3a9ec91b93da3ec4","event_uuid":"078703f3-34e8-475a-88ab-c580fc848e4f","position":{"commit_sha":"126cefb684ff48efebaac19c6c152e761961d214","position":"1788313672568388001-078703f3-34e8-475a-88ab-c580fc848e4f"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788313665159105001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[],"description":"## Context / Problem\n\nPlanning consumes `requires_create` and `requires_parent` in `ticket_planner.py:74-82,192` and `batch_dispatch.py:524`, but production builders at `run_differs.py:568` and `create_route.py:210-216` do not emit them. A parent and child created in one pass can therefore reach Jira in the wrong order.\n\n## Approach\n\nHave production mutation builders attach the existing metadata whenever an operation needs its parent/create edge. Preserve current planner semantics and prove the dispatcher never applies a dependent child before its parent mapping exists.\n\n## Scope\n\n- mutation types and production builders\n- `run_differs.py`, `create_route.py`, planner, and batch dispatch\n- focused reconciliation create/dispatch tests\n\n## Testing\n\nCover a parent/child create batch, unrelated creates, missing parent mapping, and ordering under dispatch batching.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Production mutation construction emits `requires_create` and `requires_parent` for every applicable edge.\n- [ ] Planner ordering places required parent/create operations before dependent child operations.\n- [ ] Dispatcher coverage proves the child does not apply before its parent mapping exists.\n- [ ] Unrelated creates retain current ordering and no-op behavior.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/run_differs.py","reason":"emit dependency metadata from production mutation builders"},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/create_route.py","reason":"emit create-route dependency metadata"},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/ticket_planner.py","reason":"consume and order production metadata"},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/batch_dispatch.py","reason":"preserve dependency order at dispatch"},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/mutate/test_create_coordinator.py","reason":"prove parent/child create ordering"},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/mutate/test_create_operation_coordinator.py","reason":"prove dispatcher behavior"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","78f2-b104-e3c9-4b86"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"78f2-b104-e3c9-4b86","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["janitor","reconciler","ordering","rp19"],"ticket_id":"7545-9faa-0dd0-4f92","ticket_type":"story","title":"Emit and enforce reconciliation create-order dependency metadata","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["4adf60e4-cbaa-4213-b9ca-bce1dfccec3a","078703f3-34e8-475a-88ab-c580fc848e4f"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788328064560207001,"uuid":"9c0bbe8d-e971-4b78-a788-48afd1b3ac0f"}